*                      DUAL 1 1 on a 5 cm mesh      all cap
*      MCFD 1                                       SEGFAULTS, as it does on
*                                                   the CPS supercell
*  with "negative SPH factor ... set to 1.0" in every region of group 1 under
*  ASYM 1 -- a breakdown of the equivalence, not slow convergence.
*
